<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - VideoServer cut.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - VideoServer cut.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Goldman Sachs said it downgraded VideoServer Inc to market outperform from trading buy.</p>
<p>-- Additional details were not immediately available.</p>
<p>-- VideoServer lost 1/4 to 12-3/4.</p>
</text>
